{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21571","headline":"予病瘴乐天寄通中散碧腴垂云膏仍题四韵以慰远怀开坼之间因有酬答 · 元稹","name":"予病瘴乐天寄通中散碧腴垂云膏仍题四韵以慰远怀开坼之间因有酬答","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫河变链红霞散，翠液煎研碧玉英。\n金籍真人天上合，盐车病骥轭前惊。\n愁肠欲转蛟龙吼，醉眼初开日月明。\n唯有思君治不得，膏销雪尽意还生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}